SUMMARY:Solar Radioastronomy and Heliospheric Space Missions : The legacy of Monique Pick
DESCRIPTION:The workshop is dedicated to the topics that Monique Pick has strongly contributed to build and develop in the course of her career \; solar ground-based radio interferometry at Nançay\, solar energetic particles using « multi-messenger » studies (radio and direct detections by spacecrafts and neutron monitors)\, ground-based and space-based observations of solar flares\, energetic particles\, radio si\nhttps://mpworkshop.sciencesconf.org
LOCATION:Jules Janssen Conference Center . • Postal address and pedestrian access: Observatoire de Paris\, site de Meudon - 5\, place Jules Janssen\, F-92195 Meudon cedex • Vehicle access: 11\, avenue Marcelin Berthelot\, 92195 Meudon - Meudon (France)
URL:https://mpworkshop.sciencesconf.org
END:VEVENT
