UID:0a9746a3413b@paris-academique
DTSTAMP:20260925T071908Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261015
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261016
SUMMARY:2nd Workshop CHIREX - PEPR SPIN
DESCRIPTION:The 2rd Workshop of the CHIREX – PEPR SPIN project will take place at FIAP\, Paris on October 15-16\, 2026. The workshop will bring together the CHIREX partners as well as the ACOUSKYR (AAP PEPR-SPIN) and MASKY (PEPR DIADEM) partners and the wider spintronics community\, to discuss recent progress and perspectives on chiral magnetic textures.\nhttps://chirex.sciencesconf.org
LOCATION:FIAP Paris 30 rue Cabanis 75014 PARIS https://www.fiap.paris/ - Paris (France)
URL:https://chirex.sciencesconf.org
END:VEVENT
