SUMMARY:AI and the future of mathematics and physics
DESCRIPTION:The Seed seminar of mathematics and physics is a seminar series that aims to foster interactions between mathematicians and theoretical physicists\, especially among young researchers. It is structured into three-month thematic periods\, the autumn 2026 one being on AI and the future of mathematics and physics . We open this thematic trimester with an in-person kick-off event at the Institut Henri P\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/17376/
